graph TD
    classDef danger fill:#FEF2F2,stroke:#EF4444,stroke-width:2px,color:#991B1B;
    classDef success fill:#F0FDF4,stroke:#22C55E,stroke-width:2px,color:#166534;
    classDef neutral fill:#FFFFFF,stroke:#E5E7EB,stroke-width:2px,color:#111827;
    classDef governance fill:#F0F9FF,stroke:#0EA5E9,stroke-width:2px,color:#0369A1;

    A[Agent Generates Payload] ::: neutral --> B{Context Compression Engine} ::: governance
    
    B -->|Tokens < Max| C[Payload Approved] ::: success
    
    B -->|Tokens > Max| D[Execute Memory Priority Policy] ::: governance
    
    D --> E[Drop P4 Noise] ::: neutral
    D --> F[Summarize P3 History] ::: neutral
    D --> G[Truncate P2 File States] ::: neutral
    
    E & F & G --> H[Re-calculate Tokens] ::: governance
    H --> C
    
    C --> I{Context Boundary Validator} ::: governance
    
    I -->|P0 Rules Intact| J[Send to LLM API] ::: success
    
    I -->|P0 Rules Violated| K[Halt: Context Collapse Detected] ::: danger
    K --> L[Trigger Checkpoint Rotation] ::: governance
